  "title": "Butterscotch Pull-Apart Rolls",
  "description": "These delicious butterscotch pull-apart rolls are made with store-bought frozen white dinner rolls and are baked in a Bundt pan. Prepare the night before and bake in the morning.",
  "authors": [
